00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>いっさいがっさい Yes! SONIC!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>アブナイヨと Have A Nice は似てる</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>そう　どちらも紙一重なのさ</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>タイクツ脱ぎ捨てて　今すぐかけだせ</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:34.900
The Metarex stole the Planet Egg, our planet's life source.

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:39.200
The seven Chaos Emeralds were also scattered throughout the universe.

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:44.410
We need the power of all the Chaos Emeralds to defeat them.

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:49.170
But we only have one.

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:52.340
The journey is just getting started.

00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:58.610
Episode 58

00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:58.610
The Girls' Jungle Trap!

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:34.590
Red alert! Enemies approaching!

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:38.050
Over there!

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:45.220
Metarex!

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:49.770
They're trying to escape with that planet's Planet Egg!

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:51.850
Battle stations, everyone!

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:54.360
We're taking the Planet Egg from Metarex!

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:55.190
Roger!

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:01.240
Fire the laser cannon!

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:05.660
It bounced off!

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:15.380
The outer hull is damaged! It's trying to crush our ship!

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:18.380
We'll use the main cannon! Engine Room, are you ready?

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.260
We're good to go!

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:23.050
Begin charging the Sonic Driver with energy!

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:34.940
Okay!

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:44.570
Fire Sonic Driver!

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:06.680
Metarex destruction confirmed! Start cooling the engine!

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:08.640
Energy is down 80%.

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:09.850
He did it!

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:12.020
The Metarex is destroyed!

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:14.190
Sonic does it again!

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:18.860
But wait a second. How's Sonic coming back?

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:26.370
What's wrong?

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:29.910
It's about the Sonic Driver retrieval system.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:36.330
It's supposed to bring Sonic back to the ship, but it's not finished yet.

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:38.960
Or more accurately, I never thought of making one...

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:41.340
In other words, there's nothing we can do.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:43.970
What?

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:04.030
I'm sorry! I didn't hit you on purpose.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.660
Eggman?

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.580
Wow, a Chaos Emerald.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:18.460
Eggman found it.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.840
How lucky!

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:32.970
Bro!

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:36.600
He's completely destroyed!

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:42.190
Aww, c'mon! I'm not courageous!

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:45.860
What am I supposed to do by myself?

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:50.620
They're super strong, so I don't have a chance against them.

00:05:56.830 --> 00:06:02.840
They're already here!

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:07.130
I know! If I can't beat them head-on, then I have to trap them!

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:11.850
Hey! Take me with you!

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:16.730
It's dangerous outside. There may be other Metarex around.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.730
I can deal with that!

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:24.030
I promise to find Sonic, so stay and help Chris.

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:27.240
Modifying the cannon is top priority.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:30.910
A hot-headed girl will only get in our way.

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:32.240
What did you say?

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:34.410
Tails, hurry up and go!

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:35.200
Roger.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.540
Hold it!

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:49.010
You'll pay for this!

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:57.480
There are lots of large trees!

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:04.690
The forest is scared because they lost their Planet Egg.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:07.490
At this rate, they'll all die.

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:12.030
I hope we get the Planet Egg back for them as soon as possible.

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.490
Yes.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.210
Amy?

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:23.790
Where are you going?

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:27.050
To look for Sonic, of course!

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:30.510
Didn't Tails and Knuckles already leave?

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:35.680
A lady must take back what's important to her with her own hands.

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:38.220
Tell Chris. Bye.

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:40.520
Amy!

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:45.520
Take back what's important to you with your own hands...

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:49.530
Cosmo?

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:59.450
Please wait!

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:10.460
Amy! Bring me Cord #3 and a circuit board!

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.550
Amy? Cream?

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:19.310
It can't be...

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:30.400
Not only is Amy gone, but so are Cream and Cosmo!

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:35.110
This is Typhoon. Amy, answer me!

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:40.160
Her communicator is turned off!

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:43.960
This is Typhoon here. X-Tornado, answer me!

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:47.380
This is X-Tornado. Is something wrong, Chris?

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:50.170
Amy's gone, and so are Cream and Cosmo!

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:51.760
What?

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:53.220
Sheesh!

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:57.260
Sorry, but can you retrieve them for me?

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:02.100
The Chaos Emerald is detecting something!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:05.600
That means there's another Chaos Emerald nearby!

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:06.850
That's great!

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:08.690
What's going on?

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:12.690
Just wait! I'll also bring back a Chaos Emerald!

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:14.530
I'm speeding up!

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:18.120
Tails? Knuckles? Hey!

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:21.950
Sheesh, everybody's doing whatever they want!

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:26.000
Sonic!

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:36.970
Are you okay?

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:45.980
Sorry.

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:48.270
You don't have to come if you don't want to.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:52.780
I'll find Sonic and the Planet Egg for you.

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:55.860
No, I'm fine. Let's hurry!

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:59.700
If you insist.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:02.410
I must protect this planet.

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:05.960
I can't let this planet end up the same way as my planet.

00:10:21.340 --> 00:10:23.680
Cosmo! Run!

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:31.230
It's my mission because I'm the only one who survived.

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.450
Planet Egg...

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:41.700
Are you sure?

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:45.700
Why is it here?

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:50.040
It doesn't look like there are any Metarex around here.

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:54.880
Doesn't it seem fishy? It's as if someone wants us to take it.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:56.880
I'll go get it.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.840
But Cosmo...

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:04.350
Even if it's a trap, I must retrieve the Planet Egg.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:23.070
No! What is this?

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:26.540
You fell into my trap!

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.040
Metarex!

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:34.340
You should say your prayers. I'm taking this.

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:55.310
That was easy! I'll capture you all one by one.

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:58.360
There's no way that you'll be able to catch Sonic.

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:02.660
You don't sound convincing when you're inside a cage, little lady.

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:06.120
Amy, please calm down.

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:10.500
I'm going to set my next trap.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:14.790
I'll deal with you later. I hope you're looking forward to it.

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:18.000
Whatever! You're the one who has something to look forward to!

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:20.630
Sonic is going to beat you up!

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:22.550
Amy!

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:23.840
I'm sorry.

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:29.310
I should've been the only one who was captured, but I got you involved.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.900
Did you say something?

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:37.980
No...

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:43.240
We have to find Sonic before Metarex comes back.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:48.740
Shouldn't we return to the ship first? Chris must be worried about us.

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:54.250
No way! That would ruin my "Rescue Sonic Lovey-Dovey" plan!

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:57.840
I have to try harder.

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:01.920
If I keep holding you back, I won't be able to save the planet.

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:04.430
Look at that.

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:16.020
It's definitely a trap.

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:20.150
It's using the same trap every time?

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:24.030
Even if it's a trap again, I'm going to retrieve the Planet Egg!

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:25.860
Wait, Cosmo!

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:29.370
If I'm the only one who's going to get caught, then that's fine!

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:46.090
You fell into my trap- What?

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:49.800
You again! How did you get out of that cage?

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:52.430
We're not going to tell you!

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:55.770
Still, you're pathetic for falling for the same trap twice.

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.770
I won't let you escape this time!

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:04.900
Cheese, let's go!

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:07.910
Cheese Shot!

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.380
Let's go!

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:25.420
We should go back to the ship first.

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:28.260
No! I don't want Tails and Knuckles to find him before me!

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:31.050
I'm the one who's going to find him!

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:38.560
Amy, Cream and Cheese are incredible, but all I do is screw up.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:42.020
Since we retrieved the Planet Egg, it all worked out.

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:44.570
I guess you're right...

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:49.700
Don't think too hard. Just do what you think is right.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.620
Amy...

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:58.210
I set my mind on finding Sonic, so I won't cry no matter what challenges I face.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:01.210
That's why I'm not going back to the ship.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:05.000
I guess I have no choice. I'll help.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:08.420
Cheese says he'll do his best too.

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:10.090
Thank you.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:13.470
Do what I think is right...

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:16.930
Cosmo, we'll help you too, of course.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:19.230
Amy, Cheese and me.

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:20.600
Cream...

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:25.860
Cosmo!

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:30.910
Got it!

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:33.490
That scared me.

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:39.000
Why?

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.050
I can't see!

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:51.090
You'll pay for this!

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:01.520
You can't escape!

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:02.190
This way!

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:09.240
I did it! I caught them!

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:15.410
I never give up!

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:22.250
Cream and Cosmo, here we go!

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:23.170
Okay!

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:38.430
We did it!

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:41.560
We're invincible when we work together!

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.150
Sonic!

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:54.660
Tails, I found the Chaos Emerald!

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:56.530
It really was here!

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:59.080
Hold on. I'm going to land.

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:19.100
Eggman!

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:24.100
I'm taking back the Chaos Emerald, because I found it first.

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:26.850
But you'll use it to do something bad!

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:31.690
You can watch what I'm going to do!

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:35.660
Chaos Emerald retrieval complete.

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:37.620
Powering up!

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:43.700
You're not getting away!

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:44.910
Lay off!

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:52.300
What just happened?

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:53.630
Outta my way!

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:58.550
Sonic!

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:01.640
They've rejoined their friends!

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:04.180
Sonic, I was worried about you!

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:05.640
Amy, let me go!

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:07.190
No more kiss!

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:11.690
Look! We all worked together to retrieve the Planet Egg!

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:16.570
How dare you kick the elderly!

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:19.370
I'll punish you all!

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:21.660
Full power!

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:36.970
I have nothing to do with this! Let me go!

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:42.050
I don't care! You'll feel sorry after you taste my power!

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:55.780
What's happening?

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:59.910
The Planet Egg's energy is accelerating the trees' growth!

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:02.200
This is the power of the planet's life force!

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:06.250
Who cares! We can't move!

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:07.790
No way!

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:18.340
This is Typhoon.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:25.720
I can't understand! Everyone needs to calm down!

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:29.730
Try harder and cut these vines!

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:32.230
No matter how many we cut, they keep growing!

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.320
Cosmo, stop it!

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:38.110
I don't know how to stop it! I'm sorry!

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:46.370
Sonic!

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.000
Chris!

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:50.540
Just a little more...

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:52.250
I have it!

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:53.210
Sonic!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:54.710
I got it!

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.720
Sonic, here it comes!

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:32.580
You'll pay for this!

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:38.380
It's all right!

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:44.470
Or maybe not.

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:15.460
What an ordeal.

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:17.210
You can say that again.

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:19.300
Hey, you...

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:27.680
I'm really sorry for what I did.

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:30.640
I won't try to steal the Planet Egg again.

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:36.520
Just kidding.

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:38.360
You let your guard down!

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:42.610
I knew you were up to something.

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:57.880
This can't be happening!

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:17.900
We finally have the second one.

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:20.230
I'm sure we'll find the next one soon.

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:23.610
You're finally happy now.

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:24.360
Yes!

00:22:24.650 --> 00:22:28.490
If we work together, it will all work out!

